  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Nine league titles. That's how many Barcelona won in the years they were paying Negreira's companies.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "THE NINE TITLES",
        "sub": "La Liga · 2001 to 2018",
        "pill": "THE QUESTION FANS ASK"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The payments to the referees' vice-president ran from two thousand and one to twenty eighteen.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "timeline",
        "title": "The payment years",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "2001",
            "label": "Payments begin"
          },
          {
            "year": "2018",
            "label": "Payments end"
          },
          {
            "year": "2023",
            "label": "Case opens"
          },
          {
            "year": "2026",
            "label": "No verdict"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So fans keep asking one question. Who finished second in those seasons?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "negreira",
        "label": "THE QUESTION",
        "mood": "flat"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty oh five and twenty oh six: Barça champions, Real Madrid second both times.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "Barça v runner-up",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "2004-05 · Real Madrid 2nd",
            "value": "84 v 80",
            "club": "rma"
          },
          {
            "name": "2005-06 · Real Madrid 2nd",
            "value": "82 v 70",
            "club": "rma"
          },
          {
            "name": "2008-09 · Real Madrid 2nd",
            "value": "87 v 78",
            "club": "rma"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then the Guardiola years. Twenty oh nine, twenty ten, twenty eleven. Madrid second every time.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "title": "Three in a row",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "2008-09"
          },
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "2009-10"
          },
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "2010-11"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty ten was the closest: ninety-nine points to ninety-six.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "2009-10",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "99",
            "l": "Barcelona"
          },
          {
            "n": "96",
            "l": "Real Madrid"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty thirteen, Barça hit a hundred points. Madrid fifteen behind.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "2012-13",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "100",
            "l": "Barcelona"
          },
          {
            "n": "85",
            "l": "Real Madrid"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty fifteen and twenty sixteen were razor thin. Two points, then one.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "The tight ones",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "2014-15 · Barcelona",
            "value": "94",
            "club": "bar",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "2014-15 · Real Madrid",
            "value": "92",
            "club": "rma"
          },
          {
            "name": "2015-16 · Barcelona",
            "value": "91",
            "club": "bar",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "2015-16 · Real Madrid",
            "value": "90",
            "club": "rma"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And twenty eighteen, the last payment year? Atlético were second, fourteen points back.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "2017-18",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "93",
            "l": "Barcelona"
          },
          {
            "n": "79",
            "l": "Atlético Madrid"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Add it up. Real Madrid were runners-up in eight of the nine.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "Runner-up count",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "Real Madrid",
            "value": "8",
            "club": "rma",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "Atlético Madrid",
            "value": "1",
            "club": "atm"
          },
          {
            "name": "Anyone else",
            "value": "0"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the important bit. No court has said any game or any title was affected by the payments.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "NOT PROVEN",
        "color": "white"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Barcelona deny everything.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "quote",
        "person": "laporta",
        "text": "Barcelona has never bought referees."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So it's a question, not a verdict. All nine titles still stand, and the case is still open.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "Where it stands",
        "body": "No trial, no verdict. LaLiga says sporting sanctions are time-barred. UEFA's 2023 file is still open."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
      "scene": {
